19:40.940 --> 19:43.360
[Rencana Pelarian si Pemalas]

19:41.670 --> 19:43.800
Kenapa Li Shiliu
begitu melindungi Nan Heng?

19:43.800 --> 19:44.780
Apakah

19:46.240 --> 19:48.120
